WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.125
This was Salvalo's first radio interview,

2
00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:07.240
on Cheo Noguera's show on OK 101.5 FM in Barquisimeto.

3
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:12.943
I was in the studio, and Abrahan, my co-founder,

4
00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:15.200
joined from Madrid.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.057
I gave him the usual example: you bake ten cachitos,

6
00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:21.135
at four you have three left,

7
00:00:21.135 --> 00:00:23.360
and you make a pack with them.

8
00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.070
And on the livestream people were asking us how to

9
00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:30.928
download it, and we explained what Salvalo is to all

10
00:00:30.928 --> 00:00:32.338
our dear listeners.
